Okay, I think this is a usability thing. With the pet store, the code generated out of the box is fine.

For example, here's Pet.ts

```ts
import type { HTTP_PUT } from "../path-types/pet.types.js";
import type { HTTP_POST } from "../path-types/pet.types.js";

export const PUT: HTTP_PUT = ($) => {
  return $.response[200].random();
};

export const POST: HTTP_POST = ($) => {
  return $.response[200].random();
